{"server":"tw","storyId":"act16d5_level_act16d5_01_beg","groupId":"act16d5","stageId":"act16d5_01","title":"初醒","storyCode":"WR-1","avgTag":"行動前","sourcePath":"vendor/ArknightsGamedata/tw/gamedata/story/activities/act16d5/level_act16d5_01_beg.txt","sourceHash":"8e38e12e3d7ffde2ceb754604e6bcc9d7baca90d44ec63c0467df9bd81b0a487","bodyAvailable":true,"summaryText":"聽完了說書人的故事，炎熔一行已然身處一座奇異小鎮。種種古怪卻讓他們意識到，自己也許已經身陷困境。","blocks":[{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_black"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"書接上回，說那跛腳書生敗興而歸，自此之後，鬱鬱不得志。\n哪件事？\n自然是畫。\n什麼畫？\n是那書生痛失故友，心如死灰，一蹶不振十數載後，再一次地靈犀一動——他打定心思，殫心竭慮，發誓要完成那幅畢生力作。\n要畫什麼？\n要畫未見之物。\n要如何畫？\n得作未想之想。\n誒，話說到這，就有點意思了。各位都知道，人所想像之極限，一定是所見所知的經驗。要靠想像勾勒出未曾知曉的事物，騙別人簡單，騙自己，難如登天。\n畢竟這天底下，哪有能想出自己沒見過的東西的能人呢？\n那書生對著白紙苦思十來天，瘦了足足三十多斤。本就跛腳，形貌越來越恐怖。\n時入深冬，書生家早已斷糧。鄰里害怕他那副模樣，皆不敢近。\n直到某天，跛腳書生幾度朦朧醒來，四肢無力，卻頭腦清明。"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_white"},{"type":"narration","text":"他深知自己大限將至。環顧四周，家徒四壁，恍惚間，只感覺四下無物，真真正正變成了孑然一身。\n書生逐漸看不見眼前被大雪打濕又凍上的地面，再聽不見門窗漏出的風雪動靜。睜眼眨眼，落入混沌，感到牆壁正在遠遊離去，書案消散，筆墨紙硯皆如過眼雲煙。\n某個時刻，他忽然得知了窗外鵝毛大雪的具體數目，得知了月光的角度與雲層的真理。他伸手摸索夜幕，又不小心摔倒在地，地面卻不再是雙腳的阻礙，他墜向地底，而又飛向深空。\n他睜眼卻不能看，凝神卻不能聽，周遭黑暗一片——他卻反而忽地狂喜起來，好像只有在這絕無外物干擾的境地，他才能尋到真正的創作，而非對其他已有事物的臨摹與褻瀆。\n他繼續等，等到寂滅一片，連自己乾枯的肉身也感受不到，他才開始思考——只有在這萬事萬物都不復存在，唯有他的意識獨自清明時，他短暫地成為了他精神的主宰。"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_light"},{"type":"narration","text":"他的想像再也不受拘束，創造著存在也不存在的事物——在他思維的疆土上，各種怪誕平地而起，蓋過了現實。\n那天深夜，隔壁半夜起床的老夫子，看見跛腳書生的茅屋裡流光溢彩，光怪陸離，發出各種平生未聞的聲響，難以名狀。老夫子起膽，就隔著牆偷瞄了一眼。\n只那一眼，便再不敢深究。他匆匆忙忙回到屋裡，久久不得入眠。\n隔天，鄰里紛紛來到茅屋前，奪門而入，發現了書生的遺體，再無別物。大家都以為他是凍死的，村長上前一看，書生面前攤著一張白紙，落滿了霜，啥也沒畫。\n事後，人們便感慨書生走不出過往，癡死在畫卷前。也有說是書生早就染了怪病，控制不住自己的法術，才搞出這些怪事。\n唯一窺見真相的老夫子，卻從不對別人說起這件事。只是在他臨終前，他對自己的兒子說，那被人唾棄，連名字都被忘記的跛腳書生，是真正的千古大家。"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_landscape"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"村民","speakerId":"avg_npc_140","isRemote":false,"text":"為什麼？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"說書人","speakerId":"avg_npc_138","isRemote":false,"text":"因為那個跛腳書生在那晚切實完成了諾言，切實畫出了“世間從未有過之物”。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"村民","speakerId":"avg_npc_140","isRemote":false,"text":"怎麼感覺和書上寫的內容不大一樣？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"說書人","speakerId":"avg_npc_138","isRemote":false,"text":"老夫子來不及說出為什麼，或者壓根就說不出為什麼就咽了氣。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"說書人","speakerId":"avg_npc_138","isRemote":false,"text":"於是坊間流傳的說辭，就只有跛腳書生從春風得意到失魂落魄的這麼一段。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"說書人","speakerId":"avg_npc_138","isRemote":false,"text":"至於真相如何，恐怕無人知道了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"村民","speakerId":"avg_npc_140","isRemote":false,"text":"可是畫沒見過的東西，那有什麼難的嘛，我回去亂塗一幅，你們不也沒見過。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"說書人","speakerId":"avg_npc_138","isRemote":false,"text":"欸，話不能這麼說。你從沒見過大湖，但見過雨後積水，我便告訴你，湖是很多的積水。說到底，你還是見過的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"說書人","speakerId":"avg_npc_138","isRemote":false,"text":"這跛腳書生，厲害就厲害在這兒了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"村民","speakerId":"avg_npc_140","isRemote":false,"text":"那照你這麼說，他到底畫了什麼？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"說書人","speakerId":"avg_npc_138","isRemote":false,"text":"誰知道呢。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"村民","speakerId":"avg_npc_140","isRemote":false,"text":"嘿，能不能別老講這麼複雜的，什麼時候講講其他的？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"孩子","speakerId":"avg_npc_142","isRemote":false,"text":"我要聽上次那“形單影隻向天去，雌雄雙劍分天下”的大結局！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"說書人","speakerId":"avg_npc_138","isRemote":false,"text":"會講的，都會講的。天下講不完的事，我用寥寥百年的陽壽去講，要是還奢求面面俱到，就有點貪得無厭了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"說書人","speakerId":"avg_npc_138","isRemote":false,"text":"既然你們想聽，那下一回就講點別的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"孩子","speakerId":"avg_npc_142","isRemote":false,"text":"好耶！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"說書人","speakerId":"avg_npc_138","isRemote":false,"text":"老規矩，我這張嘴，不值錢。但是諸位的茶錢，得看著給。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"說書人","speakerId":"avg_npc_138","isRemote":false,"text":"今日似乎有幾位新面孔，不知三位客人對我這些奇聞怪談，可還滿意？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"炎熔","speakerId":"char_1011_purgatory","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克洛絲","speakerId":"avg_npc_144","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"烏有","speakerId":"char_455_nothing","isRemote":false,"text":"......這是真事？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"說書人","speakerId":"avg_npc_138","isRemote":false,"text":"若是說有個書生染了礦石病，遂願之前便鬱鬱而終，我倒確信是件真事。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"說書人","speakerId":"avg_npc_138","isRemote":false,"text":"添油加醋，方有滋味啊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"烏有","speakerId":"char_455_nothing","isRemote":false,"text":"在理！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"說書人","speakerId":"avg_npc_138","isRemote":false,"text":"多謝。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"說書人","speakerId":"avg_npc_138","isRemote":false,"text":"只不過，我也不知道這些奇聞野史，到底有幾分是真的......只是有這方面的興趣，僅此而已。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"說書人","speakerId":"avg_npc_138","isRemote":false,"text":"話說回來，我雖然不是什麼正兒八經的說書人，也在鎮上以此打發了許久光陰，不過願意來聽我胡說八道的，其實就那麼幾位。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"說書人","speakerId":"avg_npc_138","isRemote":false,"text":"這看著三位面生，不知？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"炎熔","speakerId":"char_1011_purgatory","isRemote":false,"text":"咳——（使眼色）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"烏有","speakerId":"char_455_nothing","isRemote":false,"text":"啊——是了是了，我這兩位朋友，遠道而來，要找個人。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"烏有","speakerId":"char_455_nothing","isRemote":false,"text":"不過這二位在咱們大炎這裡人生地不熟的，所以我就略幫小忙，代為引路，不知先生怎麼稱呼？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"說書人","speakerId":"avg_npc_138","isRemote":false,"text":"我離家多年，早就棄了舊名不用。早年舞文弄墨，自號“煮傘居士”，雖有些恬不知恥，但也沿用至今。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"烏有","speakerId":"char_455_nothing","isRemote":false,"text":"好意境！好意境啊！這不巧了，小弟也是被迫無奈，背井離鄉，如今也只好借“烏有”二字暫代姓名，不如你就喊我烏老弟吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"炎熔","speakerId":"char_1011_purgatory","isRemote":false,"text":"（我就說他這名字是編的吧——！？）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克洛絲","speakerId":"avg_npc_144","isRemote":false,"text":"（噓......）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"炎熔","speakerId":"char_1011_purgatory","isRemote":false,"text":"（克洛絲？你發現什麼了？）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克洛絲","speakerId":"avg_npc_144","isRemote":false,"text":"（嗯？啊，沒有啦，我只是覺得看他每次都要生編硬套很好玩嘛。）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"炎熔","speakerId":"char_1011_purgatory","isRemote":false,"text":"（......）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"說書人","speakerId":"avg_npc_138","isRemote":false,"text":"原來同是天涯淪落人，那不知道三位要找的人，是誰？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"烏有","speakerId":"char_455_nothing","isRemote":false,"text":"俗話說得好，相逢即是緣，真是巧得不能再巧了。我們要找的人，也是個畫家。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"說書人","speakerId":"avg_npc_138","isRemote":false,"text":"......畫家？這小鎮不大，可從未聽說過有什麼畫家。是個什麼樣的人？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"烏有","speakerId":"char_455_nothing","isRemote":false,"text":"呃......恩人？您和他說說？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"炎熔","speakerId":"char_1011_purgatory","isRemote":false,"text":"是一位女性。呃，頭上應該長著奇特的角。還會一些奇特的法術。然後......然後......是個畫家。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"說書人","speakerId":"avg_npc_138","isRemote":false,"text":"就這樣？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"炎熔","speakerId":"char_1011_purgatory","isRemote":false,"text":"......就這樣。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"說書人","speakerId":"avg_npc_138","isRemote":false,"text":"你這麼一說，就更沒印象了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"烏有","speakerId":"char_455_nothing","isRemote":false,"text":"唔，這就奇了怪了......莫非二位恩人要找的人，已經離開了這裡？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"說書人","speakerId":"avg_npc_138","isRemote":false,"text":"這小鎮極少有來客，要是如各位所說，那位奇人當給我們留下印象才是。我可以托人幫你問問。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"烏有","speakerId":"char_455_nothing","isRemote":false,"text":"好，好，那就不叨擾先生了，我們這就——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"烏有","speakerId":"char_455_nothing","isRemote":false,"text":"這就......？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"說書人","speakerId":"avg_npc_138","isRemote":false,"text":"烏有先生？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"炎熔","speakerId":"char_1011_purgatory","isRemote":false,"text":"喂，你怎麼了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"烏有","speakerId":"char_455_nothing","isRemote":false,"text":"啊，嘿嘿，我們......我們是從哪裡進來的？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"炎熔","speakerId":"char_1011_purgatory","isRemote":false,"text":"你在說什麼，我們不是——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"說書人","speakerId":"avg_npc_138","isRemote":false,"text":"——沿著這條小道，便可離開園林。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"說書人","speakerId":"avg_npc_138","isRemote":false,"text":"想必幾位是跟著人群來這裡，迷了路吧？哈哈，我這園子不大不小，實在認不得路，問個傭人便是。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"烏有","speakerId":"char_455_nothing","isRemote":false,"text":"嘿......你瞧我這糊塗的，怎麼就記不住了呢。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"說書人","speakerId":"avg_npc_138","isRemote":false,"text":"若是關於那位畫家，找到了什麼線索需要幫忙，儘管問我。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"說書人","speakerId":"avg_npc_138","isRemote":false,"text":"我還有點事情，諸位，不送。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"烏有","speakerId":"char_455_nothing","isRemote":false,"text":"誒，多謝多謝，不用送，不用送。二位恩人，我們先走吧？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"炎熔","speakerId":"char_1011_purgatory","isRemote":false,"text":"等等——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_town"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"烏有","speakerId":"char_455_nothing","isRemote":false,"text":"接下來，我們去哪裡瞧瞧？這茶館，驛站，園子都去過了，還有什麼地方可能有線索的？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"炎熔","speakerId":"char_1011_purgatory","isRemote":false,"text":"......我們到這裡多久了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"烏有","speakerId":"char_455_nothing","isRemote":false,"text":"唔，怎麼突然問這個？大概......三兩天時日？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"炎熔","speakerId":"char_1011_purgatory","isRemote":false,"text":"你確定？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"烏有","speakerId":"char_455_nothing","isRemote":false,"text":"啊哈哈，唉，多半是昨天晚上沒睡好，我有點迷糊了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克洛絲","speakerId":"avg_npc_144","isRemote":false,"text":"小炎熔。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"炎熔","speakerId":"char_1011_purgatory","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯......我感覺到了......但是很模糊的......好像......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克洛絲","speakerId":"avg_npc_144","isRemote":false,"text":"這種時候還是要跟著直覺走。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"炎熔","speakerId":"char_1011_purgatory","isRemote":false,"text":"直覺告訴我，現在情況很麻煩。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克洛絲","speakerId":"avg_npc_144","isRemote":false,"text":"是某種精神層面的源石技藝......？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"炎熔","speakerId":"char_1011_purgatory","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯......法術的話......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"烏有","speakerId":"char_455_nothing","isRemote":false,"text":"二位恩人，還嘀咕啥呢？再不走快點，天就要黑啦。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"炎熔","speakerId":"char_1011_purgatory","isRemote":false,"text":"說什麼呢，天色還——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"avg_ac16_1"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"炎熔","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"炎熔","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"——天......色？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克洛絲","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我們竟然從來沒有看過天空......？明明只要一抬頭就能發現的......真奇怪。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"烏有","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"恩、恩人，這是啥情況？你看那邊，好像......好像都出月亮了呀！？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"烏有","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"可現在不是大白天嗎，橋那頭怎麼都點燈籠了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"炎熔","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"看身後......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"烏有","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"耶？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"炎熔","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"......另一個方向的天邊，那是......是太陽？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克洛絲","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"啊，是不是從那頭到這頭走個來回，就相當於\"走過了\"一天一夜？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"炎熔","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"這還真......新奇。總是聽年說大炎地大物博無奇不有......還有這種景觀？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"炎熔","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"唔，等等，我口袋裡好像有什麼東西......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"炎熔","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"這是，年給我的護身符......？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":null},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"炎熔","speakerId":"char_1011_purgatory","isRemote":false,"text":"慢著......慢著！不對，不對！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"炎熔","speakerId":"char_1011_purgatory","isRemote":false,"text":"什麼叫“這種景觀”啊，我剛才在想什麼......！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克洛絲","speakerId":"avg_npc_144","isRemote":false,"text":"啊......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"炎熔","speakerId":"char_1011_purgatory","isRemote":false,"text":"烏有！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"烏有","speakerId":"char_455_nothing","isRemote":false,"text":"誒——？我在，我在！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"炎熔","speakerId":"char_1011_purgatory","isRemote":false,"text":"這裡到底是不是泥翁鎮！？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"烏有","speakerId":"char_455_nothing","isRemote":false,"text":"這......這還用說......呃......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"烏有","speakerId":"char_455_nothing","isRemote":false,"text":"這，這仔細看看似乎是有點不對，可這附近也沒有別的鎮子了呀！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"炎熔","speakerId":"char_1011_purgatory","isRemote":false,"text":"......還是不對，不對。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"炎熔","speakerId":"char_1011_purgatory","isRemote":false,"text":"克洛絲，我們從羅德島出發，先抵達了勾吳城，補給之後，翌日上午出城。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克洛絲","speakerId":"avg_npc_144","isRemote":false,"text":"然後我們在前往灰齊山的荒原上看見了一輛撞毀的車——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"烏有","speakerId":"char_455_nothing","isRemote":false,"text":"——然後二位恩人從那些畜生手裡救下了我？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克洛絲","speakerId":"avg_npc_144","isRemote":false,"text":"只是把它們帶到了適合築巢的新窩而已啦。它們也挺不容易的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"炎熔","speakerId":"char_1011_purgatory","isRemote":false,"text":"然後呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"烏有","speakerId":"char_455_nothing","isRemote":false,"text":"然後我們......？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克洛絲","speakerId":"avg_npc_144","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯嗯，然後我們直接登上了灰齊山，找到了一間破茅屋。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"炎熔","speakerId":"char_1011_purgatory","isRemote":false,"text":"我推開了那裡的......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"炎熔","speakerId":"char_1011_purgatory","isRemote":false,"text":"......門？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"炎熔","speakerId":"char_1011_purgatory","isRemote":false,"text":"鐘聲？哪裡的鐘聲？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"村民","speakerId":"avg_npc_140","isRemote":false,"text":"敲鐘了？敲鐘了！喂，快去把家裡人都喊起來！動作快！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"村民","speakerId":"avg_npc_140","isRemote":false,"text":"怎麼回事！都這麼長時間了！為什麼會是今天！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"炎熔","speakerId":"char_1011_purgatory","isRemote":false,"text":"那個......！請問發生什麼了！？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"村民","speakerId":"avg_npc_140","isRemote":false,"text":"你們，你們是外人？敲鐘就說明西邊的山裡來怪物啦！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"村民","speakerId":"avg_npc_140","isRemote":false,"text":"那些怪物見不得光，只要跑到有太陽的地方，就安全了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"烏有","speakerId":"char_455_nothing","isRemote":false,"text":"怪，怪物？什麼怪物？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"村民","speakerId":"avg_npc_140","isRemote":false,"text":"哎呀，沒空和你瞎嘮叨啦！別擋著我，我得把老婆帶到這兒來呀！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"孩子","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"媽媽！媽媽！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"村民","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"都在這兒了嗎？還少誰！快去找找！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"烏有","speakerId":"char_455_nothing","isRemote":false,"text":"恩人，恩人，咱們也趕緊去避難吧！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"烏有","speakerId":"char_455_nothing","isRemote":false,"text":"說是只要跑到有太陽的地方就沒事了？那咱們趕緊——恩人？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"炎熔","speakerId":"char_1011_purgatory","isRemote":false,"text":"......克洛絲。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克洛絲","speakerId":"avg_npc_144","isRemote":false,"text":"準備好啦。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"炎熔","speakerId":"char_1011_purgatory","isRemote":false,"text":"好。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"烏有","speakerId":"char_455_nothing","isRemote":false,"text":"——恩人！？別鬧啦，我們自己都是一團漿糊，還是先躲躲再說吧！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"烏有","speakerId":"char_455_nothing","isRemote":false,"text":"誒！誒誒！這怎麼就衝過去了！唉！我的好恩人呐，你們——等我，等我一下啊！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":null}],"observedOperators":[{"speakerId":"char_1011_purgatory","aliases":["炎熔"]},{"speakerId":"char_455_nothing","aliases":["烏有"]}]}
